Citation: Allison, I. and Craven, M. (2013) Amery Ice Shelf - hot water drill borehole, AM03 Seabird MicroCAT CTD moorings at three depths in ocean cavity beneath the shelf, Ver. 4,  <em>Australian Antarctic Data Centre</em> - <a href="http://dx.doi.org/doi:10.4225/15/525E1330CCFF3">doi:10.4225/15/525E1330CCFF3</a>, Accessed: 2020-07-02

